WEBVTT

00:24.500 --> 00:28.410
Hey, sow, where are you?

00:31.500 --> 00:36.720
Damn sow, nowhere to be
seen. What is the meaning of this?

00:37.920 --> 00:39.690
Shut up.

00:40.400 --> 00:41.400
What?!

00:46.900 --> 00:50.829
Your voice is hurting my ears.

00:50.830 --> 00:54.000
Ts. What, you're just a NEET.

00:54.830 --> 00:57.000
Hey, where is she?

00:58.500 --> 00:59.840
Hey, are you listening?!

01:00.500 --> 01:05.339
Shut up. I don't care
about her whereabouts.

01:05.340 --> 01:11.749
What is that? You should at
least watch over your own prey.

01:11.750 --> 01:13.849
That's why nobles are so...

01:13.850 --> 01:18.149
Search for her if you
want to. I'm goint to sleep.

01:18.150 --> 01:19.860
Hurry up and get out of here.

01:21.550 --> 01:26.500
What a waste of time.

01:52.750 --> 01:53.750
This presence...

01:56.560 --> 02:03.400
My, my. Some strangers entered the mansion without
permission. It's almost like they have no manners.

02:04.190 --> 02:08.070
Looks like something
troublesome is going to happen.

02:26.190 --> 02:27.959
What are you doing?

02:27.960 --> 02:28.960
Oh?

02:29.870 --> 02:30.870
Eh?

02:33.750 --> 02:36.800
I'm asking you what are you doing here.

02:38.750 --> 02:45.310
I was just talking to Justin
about something important.

02:46.050 --> 02:48.310
Right, Justin?

02:48.780 --> 02:51.750
Please don't make mess
in someone's else house.

02:52.580 --> 02:56.320
You're an eyesore.
Please hurry up and leave.

02:57.590 --> 03:02.419
Oh right, Kanato-san, where is Yui-san?

03:02.420 --> 03:04.250
I told you to get out!

03:04.750 --> 03:09.450
Oh, what an unexpected
combination we have there.

03:14.750 --> 03:18.749
I only came here to meet Eve.

03:18.750 --> 03:20.040
Hey, where is she?

03:20.041 --> 03:23.099
If you came to see here, why
are you in a place like this?

03:23.100 --> 03:27.549
You're making no sense. And there is no
chance I will tell you about her whereabouts.

03:27.550 --> 03:31.059
Now, now. It's alright,
isn't it, Kanato-kun?

03:31.060 --> 03:34.130
I'm looking for Bitch-chan too, you know?

03:34.690 --> 03:37.750
But it looks like she isn't around here.

03:39.160 --> 03:40.370
She isn't here?

03:42.400 --> 03:48.870
I wonder if I can become Adam.

03:53.110 --> 03:55.050
Triple 20.

03:58.750 --> 04:01.249
You're next, Subara-kun.

04:01.250 --> 04:04.749
Heh, shut up. Who said I'd play with you?

04:04.750 --> 04:09.259
I came her to meet
Boobs-chan, but she isn't here.

04:09.260 --> 04:11.699
You have plenty of free time
so it's okay to play, isn't it?

04:11.700 --> 04:13.800
Here, you're next.

04:14.300 --> 04:20.569
Or maybe you can't do
anything is she isn't here?

04:20.570 --> 04:23.380
Huh? She has nothing to do with this!

04:23.710 --> 04:25.110
Did I make you angry?

04:25.680 --> 04:27.779
Don't stare at me with those scary eyes.

04:27.780 --> 04:29.780
Shut up, don't talk to me!

04:35.750 --> 04:38.390
Too bad, I missed.

04:42.030 --> 04:46.270
Do you know what would happen
if you hurt the face of an idol?

04:48.070 --> 04:53.339
Seems like since Bitch-chan
isn't here, everyone is irritated.

04:53.340 --> 04:55.770
It's not like I'm really irritated.

04:56.840 --> 04:57.840
At least me.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.550
Really shut up.

05:03.280 --> 05:05.650
Hey, Subaru-kun...

05:08.690 --> 05:14.560
Geez, looks like noble young
master hates a little challenge.

05:15.090 --> 05:17.800
It's just a game, right?

05:19.750 --> 05:22.670
The night is only beginning.

05:24.570 --> 05:25.570
Right?

06:00.840 --> 06:01.840
What?

06:05.440 --> 06:09.050
I was in my room though!

06:27.100 --> 06:29.170
I was waiting for you, Eve.

06:29.750 --> 06:32.170
Ruki-kun, why are you here?

06:32.750 --> 06:35.909
How dare you to make
your master wait, Livestock?

06:35.910 --> 06:38.349
Looks like you have to be disciplined.

06:38.350 --> 06:39.520
Huh?! Umm...

06:43.250 --> 06:46.789
The one who we were looking
for is a special existence.

06:46.790 --> 06:49.350
To think of that it's
such a boring woman...

06:54.360 --> 06:58.000
I'll confirm how does Eve's blood taste.

07:06.990 --> 07:10.230
Ruki-kun!

07:12.640 --> 07:13.640
Stop that!

07:20.120 --> 07:21.250
Don't resist me.

07:31.060 --> 07:32.060
Hey!

07:37.470 --> 07:39.650
Ayato-kun!

07:40.920 --> 07:43.530
I came because I felt displeasant presence.

07:44.230 --> 07:46.750
How dare you touch my prey?!

07:50.450 --> 07:51.650
Ayato-kun!

07:54.020 --> 07:55.150
Prey?

07:55.650 --> 07:59.959
How can you treat your prey
like that? I can't bear to look at it.

07:59.960 --> 08:01.560
What did you say?

08:02.060 --> 08:05.160
It's frustrating, so how
about I take her from you?

08:05.750 --> 08:09.199
Shut up! Chichinashi's blood belongs to me!

08:09.200 --> 08:11.940
That's why I won't give
her to you. That's all.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.310
That's not fair, Ruki-kun.

08:20.350 --> 08:23.450
You sucked M-Neko-chan's blood first.

08:24.080 --> 08:26.690
That's not a problem. We
can drink it when we want.

08:27.590 --> 08:31.690
I want to drink Eve's blood.

08:44.170 --> 08:46.710
You're my prey only. Don't
let anyone else touch you.

08:47.610 --> 08:49.469
Um... Ayato-kun, I...

08:49.470 --> 08:50.710
Don't talk back to me!

08:52.240 --> 08:55.750
You're mine only. I won't
give you to anyone else.

09:02.750 --> 09:10.750
Your face is asking for it. If you desire
it so much, I'll let you feel my fangs.

09:16.520 --> 09:18.750
A-Ayato-kun!

09:21.840 --> 09:23.710
You're enjoying is so much?

09:29.280 --> 09:33.750
You only need to be
feel my fangs like this.

11:21.090 --> 11:23.260
Shall we start, Nii-san?

11:27.010 --> 11:29.430
Hmm! That's right!
